WEBVTT

00:13.540 --> 00:17.960
Hi! I'm Trusty. I've got an idea... and a song.

00:21.320 --> 00:23.650
Six little legs and one big dream

00:23.700 --> 00:25.250
A travel planner, that's my scheme

00:25.300 --> 00:27.530
I tell the AI what I need

00:27.580 --> 00:29.830
It writes the app at lightning speed

00:29.880 --> 00:31.810
A UI here, a backend there

00:31.860 --> 00:34.080
A database, deploy, and we're in the air

00:34.080 --> 00:36.170
I'm dancing on my desk tonight

00:36.220 --> 00:38.920
But wait a second, something's not right

00:39.040 --> 00:43.830
Where did my prompts go? Where did my secrets fly?

00:43.880 --> 00:47.420
Somewhere up in a cloud I don't know why

00:47.660 --> 00:51.210
Nobody's watching, nobody's listening in

00:51.260 --> 00:55.140
Home is where data is, and I keep it within

00:55.960 --> 00:59.290
Nobody's watching, it's all mine, every line

00:59.340 --> 01:05.010
My little own cloud and it's running just fine

01:05.060 --> 01:06.520
Nobody's watching

01:09.300 --> 01:11.240
Nobody's watching

01:13.240 --> 01:16.200
So I pulled the AI down to my own machine

01:16.200 --> 01:18.730
No more sending stuff to places unseen

01:18.780 --> 01:20.690
But an app's not just a chat, you see

01:20.740 --> 01:22.920
It needs a home, it needs to be free

01:22.960 --> 01:25.040
So I built myself a cloud, small and tight

01:25.060 --> 01:27.670
From my desk, to my rack, to a sovereign site

01:27.720 --> 01:30.090
Trustant gave me the ground to stand

01:30.140 --> 01:31.920
Private AI, from an ant's own hand

01:31.940 --> 01:34.280
Every line, every byte, every key that I hold

01:34.280 --> 01:38.480
Stays right here, that's the story I told

01:38.780 --> 01:42.080
Nobody's watching, nobody's listening in

01:42.320 --> 01:46.400
Home is where data is, and I keep it within

01:47.320 --> 01:50.470
Nobody's watching, it's all mine, every line

01:50.520 --> 01:56.150
My little own cloud and it's running just fine

01:56.200 --> 01:57.560
Nobody's watching

02:00.360 --> 02:02.900
Nobody's watching

02:05.380 --> 02:07.650
Trust what you build, build what you trust

02:07.700 --> 02:09.880
Keep it at home, that's a must

02:09.880 --> 02:12.390
Local, private, sovereign too

02:12.440 --> 02:15.740
Little ant, it's up to you

02:15.980 --> 02:19.840
Nobody's watching, nobody's listening in

02:20.340 --> 02:24.180
Home is where data is, and I keep it within

02:24.920 --> 02:27.980
Nobody's watching, it's all mine, every line

02:28.020 --> 02:33.690
My little own cloud and it's running just fine

02:33.740 --> 02:37.430
Nobody's watching (nobody's watching)

02:37.480 --> 02:41.590
Nobody's watching (trust what you build)

02:41.640 --> 02:44.700
Your AI, your code, your data, your cloud

02:44.860 --> 02:52.960
Nobody's watching... and I'm singing out loud
